WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.929 --> 00:00:09.947
The shift lead's tablet: every machine now, the job on it and how today has gone.

2
00:00:10.575 --> 00:00:16.162
Bag maker 2 broke down on Thursday and was back this morning.

3
00:00:17.659 --> 00:00:25.114
Every stop on record: its reason, what it counts as, how long, and the scrap it caused.

4
00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:38.369
The breakdown is on the order board the same morning: six orders late, five of them behind bag maker 2.

5
00:00:38.990 --> 00:00:46.275
Each late order with the day it can now be delivered.

6
00:00:46.888 --> 00:00:51.057
The step behind its plan, on its machine.
